INFO: This file exists only to make git track the storage/ folder, since git
doesn't track empty directories. See .gitignore — storage/* is ignored,
except this file. Uploaded/generated content (product images, etc.) goes
here at runtime and is intentionally not committed to the repo.

NOTE: Safe to delete this file once storage/ has real content in it — but if
storage/ ever becomes empty again, it'll disappear from a fresh git clone
without a placeholder file like this one.